━━━ stdout
Agent skills discovery and installation

Usage: opentide setup skills [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  discover  List the skills in the opentidehq/skills catalogue
  show      Show one skill from the catalogue

Options:
  -C, --path <PATH>
          Repository path
          
          [default: .]

      --cursor
          Copy the skills to .cursor/skills/

      --claude-code
          Write CLAUDE.md and copy the skills to .claude/skills/

      --generic
          Write AGENTS.md for any agent that reads .agents/skills/

      --github-copilot
          Write .github/copilot-instructions.md, and AGENTS.md as --generic does

      --install <INSTALL>
          Skill slug to install (repeatable); default: the rule and engineering skills

      --all
          Install every skill in the catalogue

      --plugin
          Register the opentidehq/skills Agent Plugin (skills and MCP server) for Claude Code in .claude/settings.json

      --name <NAME>
          Heading of the agent files; default: the folder name

      --org <ORG>
          Organisation named in the agent files

      --description <DESCRIPTION>
          One paragraph under the heading of the agent files

      --plan
          List the files each step would write, and write nothing

  -y, --yes
          Install without asking

      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide setup skills --claude-code --yes

━━━ stderr · empty
